  "details": "**Description**\n\nWhen we received Request Invite in an invite-able instance (Public, Group Public, Friends+, Group+, Invite+, or my own Invite or Friends Only instance) of another user, it's possible to click accept check. (This is expected)\n\nHowever, after moving to another non-invite-able instance (Group or other users Invite or Friends Only instance), it should not possible to click accept check of invite request.\n\nCurrently, it’s possible to click accept check of invite request, which is very confusing.\n\n**日本語要約**\n\nReqInを許可できるインスタンスでReqInを受けたあとにReqInを許可できないインスタンスに移動した際、ReqInを許可する操作はできるけどInviteは飛ばない問題です\n\n**Related Canny**\n\nI and my friend wrote multiple Canny about Request Invite.\n\nRequest Inviteに関わる同時に書いた他のCannyがいくつかあります\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/accept-check-of-request-invite-should-be-grayed-out-or-not-present-when-im-in-an\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/accept-check-of-request-invite-should-not-be-clickable-if-im-in-friends-instance\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/accept-check-of-request-invite-should-be-clickable-after-moving-to-friends-or-pu\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/accept-check-of-request-invite-should-not-be-clickable-after-moving-to-invite-in (this canny)",
